{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schemas/model.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "ShopProduct (docs/commerce_PRD.md §4.10): an organization-owned, publishable product (X8). Its variants are their own type",
    "(ShopVariant). Publishing (IsPublished) needs the organization's Publish role (Admin) and is refused while the product",
    "cannot sell; for goods without the ProductSafety group filled in (GA7, Reg. (EU) 2023/988 Art. 19) it is refused at",
    "publication, never at startup (ShopProductInterceptor, ProductRules.SafetyProblems). The Maintained group is the shop's.",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED. Ids are UUIDv5 of 'commerce-shop:ShopProduct[...]', written by 'npm run stamp:library-model-ids'."
  ],
